<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - TCF Financial started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TCF Financial started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of TCF Financial Corp with a neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1/4 at 38-3/4.</p>
